---
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-950 via-blue-900 to-indigo-900 text-white">
  <!-- Patrón decorativo -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg class="w-full h-full" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <pattern id="grid" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
          <path d="M 40 0 L 0 0 0 40" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="0.5"/>
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#grid)" />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <!-- Badge normativo -->
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-800/60 border border-blue-600/50 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-blue-200 mb-8">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400 animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        Conforme a Ley 2/2023 · LOJIE · Convenio OIT 190
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold leading-tight tracking-tight mb-6">
        Protege a tu equipo.<br/>
        <span class="text-blue-300">Cumple la ley.</span><br/>
        Gestiona con rigor.
      </h1>

      <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-blue-100 max-w-2xl mb-10 leading-relaxed">
        SafeWork AI es la plataforma B2B2E que integra canal seguro de denuncia, asistente IA empático,
        gestión de expedientes con firma digital y formación obligatoria — todo cifrado extremo a extremo.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <a
          href="/demo"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold bg-white text-blue-900 hover:bg-blue-50 rounded-xl transition-colors shadow-lg focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white"
        >
          Solicitar demo gratuita →
        </a>
        <a
          href="#como-funciona"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 text-base font-semibold border border-blue-400/50 text-white hover:bg-blue-800/50 rounded-xl transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white"
        >
          Cómo funciona
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Social proof -->
      <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-blue-300">
        Diseñado para empresas con Plan de Igualdad obligatorio (+ 50 trabajadores/as).
        Auditable por Inspección de Trabajo.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
